; ad/Challenge101/data/inventory
; Provider-agnostic. Defines host groups and SSH defaults. No IPs, no dict_key —
; those come from the provider inventory (providers/vmware/inventory) or, for
; bare-metal runs, inventory_disable_vagrant — passed alongside this file via
; a second -i flag. Content below matches config.json's lab.hosts exactly.
